extraction_notes: |
  Read from Rifts World Book 6: South America printed p.136 (cache p137, text
  layer), the stat block checked against a render of the page. The whole class
  sits on that one page. Experience ladder "Cibola Pincer Warriors & Cibola
  Gatherers" is on printed p.168 (cache p169), checked against a render.

  1. M.D.C. is 4D6x10+60 plus 1D4x10 per level of experience, stored as one
     formula so the per-level dice grow the pool on level-up. The book writes
     "1D4X10 M.D.C. per level"; the words "M.D.C." were dropped from between the
     dice and "per level" on purpose, or the per-level dice would not be read.
  2. S.D.C. 5D6x10 and hit points 1D4x100 are stored beside the M.D.C., the
     book giving them for non-M.D.C. worlds, the same shape as the dragon
     hatchlings. No `men_of_arms` line: the class states its pools.
  3. Attacks: four at first level, then per the Hand to Hand: Assassin table.
     Stored as `combat: { attacks: 1 }` on top of the Assassin skill''s stated
     three, which gives four at level one and lets the style''s later gains add
     on top. Not `attacks_base: 4`, which measured 2026-09-25 as adding to the
     skill''s three (seven attacks) rather than replacing it.
  4. Hand to Hand: Assassin is granted; the book prints no change or upgrade
     price, so no `hand_to_hand` block.
  5. "Track human or animal (+15%)" is one skill in the book; stored as a
     choice of Tracking (people) or Track & Trap Animals at +15%. Judgement call.
  6. The book prints Dragonese/Elven; the catalog row is Language: Dragonese.
     No literacy is granted - the book says speak.
  7. The one extra skill at levels 4, 8 and 12 from Physical or Wilderness is
     the R.C.C.''s own printed grant, so it rides `occ_related_skills` with
     count 0 and a schedule. It is not an O.C.C.-style related-skill list.
  8. The book names no O.C.C. for this race and bars none; no
     `occ_restrictions`. Its skills are what the race page grants.
  9. Horror Factor 13 is the projected value (`horror_factor`), not a save.
     The book prints no combat or save bonuses of its own.
  10. Magic and Psionics: None - `psionics_allowed: false`; no magic block.
  11. Starting equipment is a percentage split for NPCs, not a player kit -
      kept as prose, no `equipment_starting`. Money: none, stored as 0.
